# Defect Type

A type of defect classified within a process family.

All processes in the same family use the same defect types, which allows analysis of defects across projects in the family.

◇

attributes:
    - key: num
      name: Num
      details: The unique value for this defect type, every 10 value is a base type and the number to the next base are subtypes.
      rules: "[10 .. unconstrained] at 1 unit"
      type_spec: Nat
    - key: name
      name: Name
      details: A simple name for this type of defect.
      rules: unconstrained
      type_spec: STRING
    - key: description
      name: Description
      details: What kind of defects are this type.
      rules: unconstrained
      nullable: true
      type_spec: STRING


associations:
    - name: Subtype Of
      details: A defect that is a subtype of another defect.
      from_multiplicity: any
      to_class_key: defect_type
      to_multiplicity: "1"

